hat I needed to do I was  just kind of mindlessly doing it but  overall for a short for our experience I  was still completely intrigued and  interested until the very end I just  kind of sat down and enjoyed it from  beginning to end this game is pretty  inexpensive it's six bucks on steam  right now and I think it's even on sale  so you can pick up for under five I  think expand is polished and it's  elegant you won't see loading screens or  jarring titles it succeeds in creating a  reflective and thoughtful atmosphere I  found myself really relaxed the whole  time it's a very different type of game  probably not for everyone that I thought  it was a wonderful way to spend my night  I hope you guys got something out of  this short overview let me know if you  are interested in playing expand in the  comments below thanks
 

